ÿØÿÛ«symbol dc-dc-CCM-transfer-func-Mohan
  «type: X»
  «description: small-signal DC-DC CCM Transfer Function (from First Course on Power Electronics and Drives by Ned Mohan)»
  «library file: |.subckt dc-dc-CCM-transfer-func-Mohan d Vo\n.if (converter==1)\nB1 Vo 0 V=V(d) Laplace=Vin/L/C*(1+s*esr*C)/(s^2+s*(1/R/C+esr/L)+1/L/C)\n.if (Verbose)\n.display Buck: 'Vin/L/C'*(1+s*'esr*C')/(s^2+s*'(1/R/C+esr/L)'+'1/L/C')\n.endif\n.else\n.if (converter==2)\n.param Le=L/(1-D)^2\nB1 Vo 0 V=V(d) Laplace=Vin/(1-D)^2/Le/C*(1-s*Le/R)*(1+s*esr*C)/(s^2+s*(1/R/C+esr/Le)+1/Le/C)\n.if (Verbose)\n.display Boost: 'Vin/(1-D)^2/Le/C'*(1-s*'Le/R')*(1+s*'esr*C')/(s^2+s*'(1/R/C+esr/Le)'+'1/Le/C')\n.endif\n.else\n.param Le=L/(1-D)^2\nB1 Vo 0 V=V(d) Laplace=Vin/(1-D)^2/Le/C*(1-s*D*Le/R)*(1+s*esr*C)/(s^2+s*(1/R/C+esr/Le)+1/Le/C)\n.if (Verbose)\n.display Buck-Boost: 'Vin/(1-D)^2/Le/C'*(1-s*'D*Le/R')*(1+s*'esr*C')/(s^2+s*'(1/R/C+esr/Le)'+'1/Le/C')\n.endif\n.endif\n.endif\n.ends dc-dc-CCM-transfer-func-Mohan»
  «shorted pins: false»
  «rect (-500,400) (500,-400) 0 0 0 0x1000000 0xffe6c8 -1 0 -1»
